DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270315
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
SUMMARY:[Reviewer] Snapshot: Getting started - read the overview\, plan and
  statistical review
DESCRIPTION:Responsible: Reviewer (external reviewer)\n\nAbout 3-4 hours in
 cluding the call. https://github.com/pagagne/internet-security-snapshot/bl
 ob/main/docs/HOW_IT_WORKS.md (the overview)\, the registered plan (https:/
 /doi.org/10.17605/OSF.IO/3XT82\, and https://github.com/pagagne/internet-s
 ecurity-snapshot/tree/main/prereg in the repository)\, https://github.com/
 pagagne/internet-security-snapshot/blob/main/docs/STATISTICAL_REVIEW_2026-
 10-24.md. Can start in February if you confirm early.\n\nReviewer's Desk (
 tasks\, worksheets\, second-coder rounds): https://pagagne.github.io/inter
 net-security-snapshot/reviewer/ (live from 4 Dec 2026)\n\nSource: https://
 github.com/pagagne/internet-security-snapshot/blob/main/docs/schedule/sche
 dule.yaml
CATEGORIES:External reviewer
END:VEVENT
