TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
SUMMARY:[Reviewer] Snapshot: Optional - practice round as second coder (pil
 ot quarter)
DESCRIPTION:Responsible: Reviewer (external reviewer)\n\nAbout 45 minutes\,
  not scored. 20 items from the Q4 2026 pilot with Paul's answers removed: 
 mostly fix dates (open the vendor's advisory\, record when the fix was rel
 eased).\n\nReviewer's Desk (tasks\, worksheets\, second-coder rounds): htt
 ps://pagagne.github.io/internet-security-snapshot/reviewer/ (live from 4 D
 ec 2026)\n\nSource: https://github.com/pagagne/internet-security-snapshot/
 blob/main/docs/schedule/schedule.yaml
CATEGORIES:External reviewer
END:VEVENT
