 r's Desk (tasks\, worksheets\, second-coder rounds): https://pagagne.githu
 b.io/internet-security-snapshot/reviewer/ (live from 4 Dec 2026)\n\nSource
 : https://github.com/pagagne/internet-security-snapshot/blob/main/docs/sch
