BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:reviewer-packet@2027-04-02@internet-security-snapshot
DTSTAMP:20261024T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270402
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270403
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
SUMMARY:[Claude] Snapshot: Send the reviewer the Q1 2027 review packet
DESCRIPTION:Responsible: Claude (claude)\n\nOnce the provisional Q1 2027 re
 port is approved: links to the report\, the registered plan\, https://gith
 ub.com/pagagne/internet-security-snapshot/blob/main/prereg/DEVIATIONS.md\,
  the data bundle and the exact code commit\; the worksheet for every headl
 ine figure\; the sample of hand decisions with their rules\; a short revie
 w template (holds up / doesn't / would change). Before sending\, list in h
 ttps://github.com/pagagne/internet-security-snapshot/blob/main/site/review
 er/worksheets.json ("draw_from") the headline figures actually reported th
 is quarter and add their worksheets\; the reviewer draws three on the Revi
 ewer's Desk with a seed of their own (anyone can repeat it). Never choose 
 the figures.\n\nReviewer's Desk (tasks\, worksheets\, second-coder rounds)
 : https://pagagne.github.io/internet-security-snapshot/reviewer/ (live fro
 m 4 Dec 2026)\n\nSource: https://github.com/pagagne/internet-security-snap
 shot/blob/main/docs/schedule/schedule.yaml
CATEGORIES:Claude
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:external-review@2027-04-03@internet-security-snapshot
DTSTAMP:20261024T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270403
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270429
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
SUMMARY:[Reviewer] Snapshot: Independent review of the Q1 2027 provisional 
 report
DESCRIPTION:Responsible: Reviewer (external reviewer)\n\nAbout 8-12 hours. 
 Read the provisional Q1 2027 report against the registered plan and the de
 viations log\; spot-check three headline figures drawn at random (from a s
 eed you choose) plus any you pick\, recomputing each from its worksheet in
  a spreadsheet (no programming needed)\; look at the sample of hand decisi
 ons and their written rules. Send a short written review (two to five page
 s: what holds up\, what doesn't\, what you'd change) by 28 April. The wind
 ow can move a week or two if needed\; publication is 1 May.\n\nReviewer's 
 Desk (tasks\, worksheets\, second-coder rounds): https://pagagne.github.io
 /internet-security-snapshot/reviewer/ (live from 4 Dec 2026)\n\nSource: ht
 tps://github.com/pagagne/internet-security-snapshot/blob/main/docs/schedul
 e/schedule.yaml
CATEGORIES:External reviewer
END:VEVENT
