 , published each quarter.\n\nReviewer's Desk (tasks\, worksheets\, second-
 coder rounds): https://pagagne.github.io/internet-security-snapshot/review
 er/ (live from 4 Dec 2026)\n\nSource: https://github.com/pagagne/internet-
 security-snapshot/blob/main/docs/schedule/schedule.yaml
