 onth (second-coder-score). The pilot quarter's sheet is the practice round
  (2 Mar 2027).\n\nReviewer's Desk (tasks\, worksheets\, second-coder round
 s): https://pagagne.github.io/internet-security-snapshot/reviewer/ (live f
 rom 4 Dec 2026)\n\nSource: https://github.com/pagagne/internet-security-sn
 apshot/blob/main/docs/schedule/schedule.yaml
